{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_ED0137FC","title":"Yulia's Last Message","entry":"Dlg_ED0137FC::entry","exit":"Dlg_ED0137FC::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_299406A6","articyId":"72057611218018463","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"The Ghost","text":"I don’t have much time.","speakerId":"TheGhost","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don’t have much time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":-125.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19224","byteOffset":15157128,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_D31F8A55","articyId":"72057611218018477","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"The Ghost","text":"I had to run. They’ll come after me any moment. So I’m leaving, I’m going to take the Vinc to Star’s Leap, and then a shuttle to Luna.","speakerId":"TheGhost","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I had to run. They’ll come after me any moment. So I’m leaving, I’m going to take the Vinc to Star’s Leap, and then a shuttle to Luna.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":475.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29598","byteOffset":19077768,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_79D78CCF","articyId":"72057611218018498","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"The Ghost","text":"I hope you’ll meet me there. I hope we can grow old together. But if we don’t, then I want to say thank you.","speakerId":"TheGhost","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hope you’ll meet me there. I hope we can grow old together. But if we don’t, then I want to say thank you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21392","byteOffset":15980288,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_C132BAE0","articyId":"72057611218018513","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"The Ghost","text":"But with you, these last few weeks, I've been loved. I've been free. I'll see you on the other side, TC.","speakerId":"TheGhost","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But with you, these last few weeks, I've been loved. I've been free. I'll see you on the other side, TC.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2275.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37077","byteOffset":28368904,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_CFF19A50","articyId":"72057611218018526","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"She’s gone. But there's still a trace of her code in the electromagnetic field. If you want to act, you have to do it now.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She’s gone. But there's still a trace of her code in the electromagnetic field. If you want to act, you have to do it now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2875.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25016","byteOffset":17346400,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_140B2C3E","articyId":"72057611218018554","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I… it’s not for me to decide.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I… it’s not for me to decide.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48601","byteOffset":32722456,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_541A9B85","articyId":"72057611218018568","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I would set her free.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I would set her free.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4000.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24280","byteOffset":17062808,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_8E3548E2","articyId":"72057611218018589","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Very well. Activating the instruction… there. It's done.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Very well. Activating the instruction… there. It's done.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4675.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50632","byteOffset":33495816,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_A1E32BDA","articyId":"72057611218018596","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Very well. Activating the instruction… there. It's done.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Very well. Activating the instruction… there. It's done.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4675.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25934","byteOffset":17693344,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_FBD8A73E","articyId":"72057611218018627","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Her memory is now housed in my storage. If we take it to the Holocropolis, we should be able to upload it to a spare plaque. But...","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Her memory is now housed in my storage. If we take it to the Holocropolis, we should be able to upload it to a spare plaque. But...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5275.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46115","byteOffset":31776968,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_9F5567A6","articyId":"72057611218018647","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Deep in the code, I think I saw the name of the person who once held Yulia's memory.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Deep in the code, I think I saw the name of the person who once held Yulia's memory.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5875.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38652","byteOffset":28957096,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_B66204FB","articyId":"72057611218018654","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Yes, but...","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, but...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5275.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22501","byteOffset":16398544,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_CDE58346","articyId":"72057611218018677","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"There must be a mistake. A cross-contamination caused by the fragmented KorēChant.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There must be a mistake. A cross-contamination caused by the fragmented KorēChant.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6475.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51567","byteOffset":33925520,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_3E1CA3F1","articyId":"72057611218018684","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"The file name translated to Thaddeus Carminus.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The file name translated to Thaddeus Carminus.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7675.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41201","byteOffset":29914792,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_6657925D","articyId":"72057611218018706","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"An ancestor of his, maybe. I don’t suppose we’ll ever truly know. But now at least, Yulia might be at peace.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"An ancestor of his, maybe. I don’t suppose we’ll ever truly know. But now at least, Yulia might be at peace.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":8275.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36991","byteOffset":28336952,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_729EF1FD","articyId":"72057821671308554","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"The Ghost","text":"If you're hearing this voice note, then I'm already gone.","speakerId":"TheGhost","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you're hearing this voice note, then I'm already gone.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":775.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44521","byteOffset":31172792,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_1FB0F3BD","articyId":"72057821671308563","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"The Ghost","text":"I was trapped and didn’t know it. I might have stayed trapped my whole life.","speakerId":"TheGhost","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I was trapped and didn’t know it. I might have stayed trapped my whole life.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1675.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25106","byteOffset":17380128,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_4DF0E35C","articyId":"72057821671308596","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I ... can't ... don't want to ... believe it.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I ... can't ... don't want to ... believe it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7075.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33174","byteOffset":20435952,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_00ECAD44","articyId":"72057821671308618","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Ava!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ava!","TextSheVersion":"Ava!","TextTheyVersion":"Ava!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7375.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21395","byteOffset":15981512,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_0B995B1D","articyId":"72057821671308625","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Please. Go on.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please. Go on.","TextSheVersion":"Please. Go on.","TextTheyVersion":"Please. Go on."},"effects":[],"conditio